// parallel-features-8: the same task scaled to EIGHT independent modules. The first four are parallel-features unchanged (same spec text, reference code and
// hidden cases); four more of similar fiddliness are added: durations ('1h30m15s' <-> seconds), IBAN mod-97 plus Luhn, greedy word wrap with justification,
