// independent tokenizer over 300k random strings (duration); eight published IBAN examples, every single-character substitution of them against a BigInt
// mod-97 oracle, and constructed DE IBANs whose mod-97 holds with check digits 00, 01 and 99; Luhn test card numbers and an independent Luhn over 200k strings
// (exactly one valid check digit per prefix); a second wrap implementation over 100k random texts plus justify invariants; Buffer.from(...).toString('base64url')
